{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own character and immerse yourself in the world of Avataris!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between the 4 races (Gront, Eollyan, Squan and Human) and 9 classes and experience your first steps as Aeya's Champion in Eternity Online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495970/extras/Avataris_EN.gif?t=1741620705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete quests for the residents of Tumbeln, discover Easter-eggs and learn background-info about the story and races of Avataris in a setting inspired by tabletops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on the book series &quot;Eternity Online&quot; by Mikkel Robrahn, published by Fischer TOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be played with Steamdeck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1495970?t=1741620705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1495970?t=1741620705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495970/47d9d79ef48a364d861814391423c0ba7bc182c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741620705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495970/47d9d79ef48a364d861814391423c0ba7bc182c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741620705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3562080,"description":""}],"det